usage: check-revision-binding.py [-h] (--tools-revision REV | --selftest)
                                 [--branch BRANCH] [--object-selectors]

Read-only revision-binding counting probe over every --revision gate.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --tools-revision REV  required: full 40-hex commit landed on the measured
                        branch
  --selftest            hermetic stub-tool suite
  --branch BRANCH       landed branch to bind against (default master)
  --object-selectors    grade object-only hexadecimal selectors across the
                        original nine tools
